{"page":"PAN3","gene":"PAN3","accession":"Q58A45","protein":"PAN2-PAN3 deadenylation complex subunit PAN3","length":887,"disease":false,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q58A45-1","name":"1","synonyms":["Pan3b","Pan3L"],"notes":[{"topic":"Function","text":"Decreases PAN2-mediated deadenylation, possibly by preventing progression into the second CCR4-NOT mediated stage of biphasic deadenylation. Has a significant effect on mRNA stability, generally stabilizing a subset of the transcriptome. Stabilizes mRNAs degraded by the AU-rich element (ARE)-mediated mRNA decay pathway but promotes degradation of mRNAs by the microRNA-mediated pathway (PubMed:28559491). Its activity influences mRNP remodeling, specifically reducing formation of a subset of P-bodies containing GW220, an isoform of TNRC6A (PubMed:28559491)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with PAN2 (PubMed:28559491). Interacts (via N-terminus) with PABPC1 at lower efficiency than isoform 3 (PubMed:28559491)"}],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000380958.8"],"refseq":["NM_175854.8"],"maneSelect":true},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q58A45-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q58A45-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":62.7,"plddt":[[0,45],[50,1],[70,23],[50,4],[0,37],[50,1],[0,282],[50,8],[70,1],[50,2],[0,10],[50,7],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,9],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,4],[70,31],[90,12],[70,3],[50,11],[70,5],[90,25],[70,2],[90,1],[70,2],[90,40],[70,1],[90,6],[70,1],[90,1],[70,3],[50,5],[70,2],[50,2],[0,12],[50,3],[70,2],[90,37],[70,4],[90,14],[70,4],[50,3],[70,5],[90,22],[70,9],[90,24],[70,6],[90,8],[70,1],[90,7],[70,1],[90,2],[70,2],[90,1],[70,12],[90,17],[70,4],[50,4],[70,8],[90,1],[70,1],[90,22],[70,1],[90,23],[70,3],[90,20],[70,2],[90,2],[70,4],[50,2]]}},"features":[{"type":"Zinc finger","start":43,"end":71,"description":"C3H1-type"},{"type":"Region","start":147,"end":498,"description":"Necessary and sufficient for interaction with PABPC1 but not needed for interaction with PAN2"},{"type":"Mot